= Factions

We must manage our various factions

- @left: Reach out to the Left Faction
- @center: Reach out to the Center Faction
- @labor: Reach out to the Labor Faction
- @reformist: Reach out to the Reformist Faction

@left
go-to: the_left

@center
go-to: the_center

@labor
go-to: the_labor_wing

@reformist
go-to: the_reformists
